<?xml version='1.1' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<project>
    <actions/>
    <description>Load NCBI GFF3 load file for GRCz12tu.
Runs `gradle loadGff3NcbiFile` (org.zfin.sequence.gff.NCBIGff3Processor, -Xmx16g).

INPUT (external):
  https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genomes/refseq/vertebrate_other/Danio_rerio/all_assembly_versions/GCF_049306965.1_GRCz12tu/GCF_049306965.1_GRCz12tu_genomic.gff.gz
  (hard-coded. If GCF_049306965.1_GRCz12tu_genomic.gff.test exists in the working directory,
  the download is skipped and that file is parsed instead.)

OUTPUT (tables written):
  gff3_ncbi                                       one row per GFF3 feature (batched insert)
  gff3_ncbi_attribute                             retained attribute keys only:
                                                  gene_id, gene_name, gene, Parent, ID, Dbxref
  sequence_feature_chromosome_location_generated  upsert gene genomic locations,
                                                  source = NCBI_LOADER

  Note: gff3_ncbi is inserted into without a preceding truncate, so the table is expected to
  be empty (prior release removed) before a run.

REFERENCE TABLES (used for matching):
  db_link           NCBI Gene ID -&gt; ZFIN gene (selects the 1-to-1 ZFIN&lt;-&gt;NCBI records)
  marker            gene records for the located features
  assembly          GRCz12tu assembly row
  vocabulary_term   NCBI_ANNOTATION_STATUS = 'Current'
  sequence_feature_chromosome_location_generated
                    existing NCBI_LOADER locations, to decide insert vs. update

Full I/O documentation: reference/data-load-jobs.md#load-ncbi-gff3-file</description>
    <keepDependencies>false</keepDependencies>
    <properties>
        <jenkins.model.BuildDiscarderProperty>
            <strategy class="hudson.tasks.LogRotator">
                <daysToKeep>-1</daysToKeep>
                <numToKeep>-1</numToKeep>
                <artifactDaysToKeep>-1</artifactDaysToKeep>
                <artifactNumToKeep>-1</artifactNumToKeep>
            </strategy>
        </jenkins.model.BuildDiscarderProperty>
    </properties>
    <scm class="hudson.scm.NullSCM"/>
    <canRoam>true</canRoam>
    <disabled>false</disabled>
    <blockBuildWhenDownstreamBuilding>false</blockBuildWhenDownstreamBuilding>
    <blockBuildWhenUpstreamBuilding>false</blockBuildWhenUpstreamBuilding>
    <triggers>
        <hudson.triggers.TimerTrigger>
            <spec></spec>
        </hudson.triggers.TimerTrigger>
    </triggers>
    <concurrentBuild>false</concurrentBuild>
    <customWorkspace>$TARGETROOT</customWorkspace>
    <builders>
        <hudson.tasks.Shell>
            <command>cd $SOURCEROOT &amp;&amp; gradle loadGff3NcbiFile</command>
        </hudson.tasks.Shell>
    </builders>
    <publishers>
